OpenVPN Wizard v1.1.0 - Bugfix Release with Enhanced Features

Bug Fixes:
- Fixed systemd service name mismatch (server vs warp1194-tcp)
- Fixed HAProxy backend server reference (127.0.0.1:1194)
- Fixed OpenVPN config validation (removed deprecated options)
- Fixed client config generation (proper inline certs/keys)
- Fixed Termux script paths and permissions
- Fixed integration test service checks

New Features:
- Smart one-line install with auto-detection
- OVPN file retrieval via API/code with auth
- User management CLI (add/revoke/list/show)
- Complete uninstall command (clean removal)
- Quick install mode with sensible defaults
- Password-protected OVPN file generation
- Auto-generated secure passwords
- QR code for mobile OVPN import
- Health check endpoint

Enhancements:
- Better error handling and logging
- Color-coded output with progress bars
- Comprehensive documentation updates
- Improved test coverage
- Health check script for monitoring